Aljona, ten years old today, doesn't remember the siege and has grown into an intelligent and happy girl, neighbors say.
"They're a big happy family now and Aljona and Makhar are both great children," says a close friend.
Ruslan is a fantastic father and wants to spare them all the memories coming up with the 10th anniversary.
You'll understand why.
Man accused of roaming girl at pedestrian crossing in Fife
